From 22230a473edb72add40db1f6b7adf7caba7a5a8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Motz <luca.motz@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 09:42:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/29] fix: retire Mamba states across null gaps

Align-mode Mamba prefill leaves null gaps between recurrent-state checkpoints.
Retire every committed state across those gaps and remember the retired prefix
so long chunked prefills do not retain old states until request cleanup.

This is a semantic backport onto the recipe's prefix-retention and partial-tail
extensions; the upstream hunk cannot be applied verbatim to that customized
manager.

Upstream: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55450
Upstream-Head: 22230a473edb72add40db1f6b7adf7caba7a5a8f
---
